{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19534","headline":"和张相公太原山亭怀古诗 · 崔恭","name":"和张相公太原山亭怀古诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高情乐闲放，寄迹山水中。\n朝霞铺座右，虚白贮清风。\n潜窦激飞泉，石路跻且崇。\n步武有胜概，不与俗情同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔恭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19534.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19534","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}